{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dNzfXXPhiu1795492482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有市場人士認為，外圍人工智能(AI)股份反彈，有助改善港股氣氛，不過短線反彈仍有一定阻力。</p><p></p><p>富昌金融集團聯席董事譚朗蔚指出：「若先企穩23,000點，接著企穩23,800點，就是我平常所說，企穩一個就改善，企穩兩個就脫險回升，所以現在升上去，先預計這兩個位置均有阻力。在跌浪裡，我們先預計是反彈，而反彈幅度相信很大程度均在之前跌得最急，如光通訊、芯片、數據中心、印刷電路板等為主。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.632061+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:57:13.221601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:37:20.458682+00:00","content_hash":"fe363f863d271a09c2927837c83f4eeefb5d8eef6d15f318b7b5eb60b3bb9a1d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.632061+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}